# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local `wrangler dev`. Never commit `.dev.vars`.
# In production set these with: wrangler secret put NAME (or the Cloudflare dashboard)
# For local dev, point CORS at the Vite dev server:
ALLOWED_ORIGIN="http://localhost:5173"
APP_SHARED_TOKEN="dev-token-change-me"
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=""
ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_KEY=""
OPENAI_ADMIN_KEY=""
GOOGLE_API_KEY=""
